        <mxCell id="n32" value="METHOD &amp; PROOF (sketch): U_CPU = 970/17000 + 220/170000 + 800/1700000 = 5.88% per node — invariant in N (multi-rate 10 kHz / 1 kHz / 100 Hz) · UART 8N1, 3 Mbps, 32-bit payload = 4 bytes → t_frame = 40/3·10⁶ = 13.33 µs; two neighbour links in parallel = 13.33 µs wall (26.67 µs serialized); DMA link occupancy ≠ CPU load · fixed degree {self, prev, next} → O(1) computation and O(1) per-link traffic · N re-enters only through ring consensus dynamics: λ2 = 2[1−cos(2π/N)] ≈ (2π/N)², τ ≈ Ts/(k·λ2), k = 0.2 → N=16: 3.28 ms · N=64: 51.9 ms · N=90: 102.6 ms · N=128: 207.5 ms ⇒ Nmax ≈ 64–90 pure ring, &gt;256 with shortcuts/hierarchy — this Gantt is identical for any N" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=16;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
